BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Breaking Free from Low Mood and Depression
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260906T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260906T173000
UID:176f6ac2185fb7f69233979c@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this 8-week course\, based on the Mindfulness Based Cogniti
 ve Therapy programme\, we’ll explore how to stay well\, and sustain posi
 tive mental health.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/breaking-free-from-low-m
 ood-and-depression-sep-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Buddhism & Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260921T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260921T214500
UID:a4c540427c4cecc7a5e3a556@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
 key Buddhist principles and two meditation practices that cultivate self-a
 wareness\, open-heartedness\, and insight.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/introduction-to-buddhism
 -meditation-course-sep-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Who Hates the Metta Bhavana?
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260929T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260929T214500
UID:5e41a508326239c484ba8e3e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Many people struggle with the Metta Bhavana practice\, and som
 etimes give up on it altogether. This six-week course is designed to help 
 you discover how powerful – and beautiful – it can be.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/who-hates-the-metta-bhav
 ana-29-sep-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Your Mind
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T123000
UID:6c65dd9c4fb4f22b3b999774@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The state of our mind is the state of our life. We're mostly u
 naware of how our negative habits limit our experience and are oblivious t
 o the vast potential of our minds. Buddhist practice gives us the tools to
  change that and awaken to life’s depths. On the course\, we will teach 
 you some of the fundamentals of Buddhist thought\, as well as two foundati
 onal meditation practices.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/free-your-mind-deptford
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Foundations of Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261010T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261010T123000
UID:f20768689e405e2b8bc8ef21@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The human mind is the most mysterious and complex 'thing' in t
 he universe – yet the tragedy of our life is that we don't make the most
  of it. Over four weeks\, build the essential foundations for getting the 
 best out of your mind.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/foundations-of-meditatio
 n-course-10-oct-2026
END:VEVENT
