END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Qigong
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T183000
UID:1c156de938a7b02bd46b1b90@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Qigong (pronounced "chee-gong") is a system of exercises which
  helps us cultivate awareness and connect with our bodies through simple b
 reathing exercises and movement techniques\, and can be a great way to pre
 pare for meditation. Join us for a beginner-friendly session led by Serene
 . No experience necessary.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/qigong-20-oct
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tuesday Night Meditation Class
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T213000
UID:e9ef4bbc971c9749083cd133@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:You can either learn to meditate from scratch and develop the 
 foundations for a daily practice or join the regulars to build on what you
  know and discover how to apply Wisdom reflections in meditation.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/tues-night-20-oct
END:VEVENT
